  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed700.html",
  "prefLabel": "Ed 702.05 Credit Hours",
  "priorExpiration": "1996-10-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 702.05 Credit Hours.\n\n(a) Each student shall successfully complete a minimum program of 20 units for graduation including 11 ½ units as outlined in Table 702-1:\n\nTable 702-1\n\nSubjects and Units of Credit for An Adult High School Diploma\n\nSubject | Units of Credit\n\nSocial Science Including U.S. History 1 unit Economics ½ unit Civics ½ unit | 3 units\n\nEnglish | 4 units\n\nMathematics | 2 units\n\nScience | 2 units\n\nComputer Literacy | ½ unit\n\n(b) Except as provided in Ed 702.06 each one credit subject offered in this program shall meet for not less than 45 hours.\n\n(c) Except as provided in Ed 702.06 each one half credit subject offered in this program shall meet for not less than 22½ hours.\n\nSource. #2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84; ss by #4851, eff 6-25-90; EXPIRED 6-25-96\n\nNew. #6366, eff 10-30-96, EXPIRED: 10-30-96\n\nNew. #8265, eff 1-22-05; ss by #9638, eff 1-20-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed700.html"
